d aspirational for it. The cast have impeccable chemistry, which translates into totally plausible sisterly energy. Yet as things take ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/2024/nov/13/bad-sisters-season-two-review-the-sisterhood-sequel-sharon-horgan\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"971a64ee07c8ec53e0aaa1f53423670a8bffe79dcd9f7c4fd010cd63b598a371\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"63818a7f583c2d843a65f2fab3dc7827299386f46579e8c14553052ed3ee1006\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"TV show siblings real life play unrelated characters on screen\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... show.\\n\\n- Likewise, Finn Jones and Natalie Dormer could pass for brother and sister◊ in real life, despite not being related.\\n\\n- Emilia Clarke and Harry Lloyd as siblings Daenerys and Viserys Targaryen have an uncanny similarity. It's partially the wigs though. The white hair masks the differences in ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeparatedAtBirthCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d230\"},\"ref\":\"d230\",\"snippet\":\" ... the show in season four.\\n\\nNetflix calls Patrick \\\"hedonistic, stubborn, and seductive,\\\" and explains that if Ari, his twin, does exactly what their father wants and Mencía, their younger sister, does the opposite, Patrick just does what he wants.\\n\\nIn real life, Manu Ríos is the same age ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/elite-characters-ages-vs-real-life-actors-2021-6\"},{\"kin