" (2013-2018, 5 seasons) — Teri Polo. Or \"Pretty Little Liars.\" Actually, let me reconsider \"Jane the Virgin\" — the narrator is the adult Jane's son... no.\n\nLet me reconsider the \"real-life relative\" angle. A famous case: in \"The Vampire Diaries,\" there's no real-life relative. But in \"Pretty Little Liars,\" there's no. Let me think about \"Once Upon a Time\" — Jennifer Morrison. No.\n\nActually, the most famous \"real-life relative plays unrelated character\" is in \"The Fosters\" — Teri Polo and... no. Let me reconsider \"Shameless\" (2011-2021, 11 seasons). Emmy Rossum. No real-life relative.\n\nLet me reconsider the height clue (1.65-1.70m) and \"married 3-4 times, one child survives.\" This sounds like a soap opera character. Let me think about \"The Bold and the Beautiful\" or \"Days of Our Lives.\" But those started before 2000.\n\nLet me reconsider — \"first appeared in a season that started before 2020 but after 2000.\" This means the actor's first appearance was in a season that started between 2001-2019. Let me think about \"Grey's Anatomy\" (2005, 19+ seasons). A character married 3-4 times with one surviving child... Let me search for the real-life relative angle in Grey's Anatomy specifically.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Grey's Anatomy real life family members cast same show\", \"Grey's Anatomy actress real life daughter mother sister guest star\", \"Grey's Anatomy cast members related in real life\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_21c253c6feca4447aba1f996","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Grey's Anatomy character marriages list divorced three times\", \"Grey's Anatomy character one child died survived\", \"Grey's Anatomy actress height 5 foot 6 5 foot 7\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_14f08039ba854555a5e93145","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... in a new Grey's Anatomy spin-off titled Grey's New Orleans: Family Burn Unit. On its own, that's a fun nod to the show but it's made better by Grey's alum Jesse Williams also being new to the cast. Executive producer John Hoffman ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/greys-anatomy-spinoff-shows-timeline-connections-explained/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d48\"},\"ref\":\"d48\",\"snippet\":\" ... Created Grey's Anatomy\\n\\nRhimes had long been a fan of medical shows, even watching real surgery performed on documentary or reality series, so it was perhaps natural that she set her new show in a hospital, with the goal of delving into the lives and minds of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.encyclopedia.com/education/news-wires-white-papers-and-books/rhimes-shonda-lynn\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d168\"},\"ref\":\"d168\",\"snippet\":\" ... There are also a lot of shows that came before Grey's Anatomy that it owes something to, but they also never reached the overwhelming level of popularity and success as Ellen Pompeo's medical drama. While cast members came and went, fans are still sticking with the ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/best-medical-dramas-on-tv-that-are-not-greys-anatomy-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... Much of the humor arises from their domestic life, extended family dynamics, and their everyday trials and tribulations, painting a hilarious and warm portrait of an average family man.\\n\\n8 'Grey's Anatomy'\\n\\n(2005 - Present)\\n\\nYour comment has not been saved\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy\\n\\n- Release Date\\n\\n- March 27 ... \",\"title\":\"https://movieweb.com/most-watched-tv-shows-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d169\"},\"ref\":\"d169\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Daily Show\\n\\n- Release Date\\n\\n- July 22, 1996\\n\\n- Network\\n\\n- Comedy Central\\n\\n- Cast\\n\\n- Jon Stewart, Trevor Noah, Michael Showalter, Nancy Carell, Brian Unger, Rachael Harris, Samantha Bee, Matt Walsh\\n\\n- Directors\\n\\n- Chuck O'Neil\\n\\n- Seasons\\n\\n- 30\\n\\n- Creator(s)\\n\\n- Lizz Winstead\\n\\n7 'Grey's Anatomy' (2005-)\\n\\nCreated by Shonda Rhimes & Michelle ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/shows-that-defined-the-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d195\"},\"ref\":\"d195\",\"snippet\":\" ... She told EW that her decision to leave \\\"Grey's Anatomy\\\" 18 months before her contract was up stemmed from her wish to spend more time with her family, saying that adopting her daughter \\\"changed everything\\\" for her. \\\"I felt it was the right thing to do; we ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nickiswift.com/450696/tv-actors-who-said-no-to-an-episode/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d170\"},\"ref\":\"d170\",\"snippet\":\" ... 5 \\\"Golden Hour\\\"\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy - Season 7, Episode 15\\n\\nYour comment has not been saved\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy\\n\\n- Release Date\\n\\n- March 27, 2005\\n\\n- Network\\n\\n- ABC\\n\\n- Directors\\n\\n- Rob Corn, Kevin McKidd, Debbie Allen, Chandra Wilson, Allison Liddi-Brown, Jeannot Szwarc, Tony Phelan\\n\\nCas